# Upstream openclaw skills to KEEP in the built image.
#
# THIS LIST IS EMPTY, ON PURPOSE.
#
# This bot has exactly one skill — `mocker` — and it is defined in this
# repository, in k8s/050-db-mocker.yaml, mounted from the
# claw-mock-skill-mocker ConfigMap. That is the one it is supposed to have and
# the only one anybody reviewed. Everything openclaw bundles at /app/skills is
# capability the agent was never granted through a pull request.
#
# The image used to strip two of them by name — `mcporter` and
# `skill-creator` — and keep the rest. That is the wrong way round: an
# upstream release that adds another one ships it to the agent silently, and
# nobody finds out until it is used.
#
# Add a name here only with a reason, and only in a pull request that says
# what the bot needs it for.
